bbslist - board list

usage: bbslist

    Lists boards you can read. The leading (RWB) is your permission
    on that board.
      R  can read (always present for listed boards)
      W  can write a response
      B  can start a new topic (base note)
    A missing letter is a space (e.g. (RW ) is read and write only).
    The name inside < > is the board ID; the right side is the description.
    Open with open <board>.
